{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（20日）上午10時33分，荔枝角青山道688至690號嘉名工廠大廈發生火警。多人致電報警，消防員接報到場灌救，於約15分鐘後將火救熄。</p><p>事件中約60人自行疏散，有人帶着籠物匆匆走火警。其間兩人感到不適，當中姓鄭39歲男子由救護車送往明愛醫院治理。人員經初步調查，相信是電線短路肇禍；火警期間通州西街與永康街封閉。</p><p>現場消息指，起火位置於7樓，消防員架起雲梯射水。由網上片段可見，起火是一處露天有簷篷的位置，火光熊熊，濃煙往上直冒。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員架起雲梯救火。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200405619018829824458397.jpeg/mLZrqJSthIAaWEfvwShRS0hMDcrY1TsN3wQrE_oEKxM\"/><figcaption>消防員架起雲梯救火。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有街坊目擊消防員近距離救火。（Threads：imyoureunjae 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200415324227244032741935.png/ZfwfF7dPmO86XBlzUSv1mdcHye7yH_RX-8PcCvvD3Ao\"/><figcaption>有街坊目擊消防員近距離救火。（Threads：imyoureunjae 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有街坊目擊消防員近距離救火。（Threads：imyoureunjae 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200415326739763200103268.jpeg/Sv4yAafIWh4um8ecRoF6p7usyRzVdc2YrPIP2qzyD9o\"/><figcaption>有街坊目擊消防員近距離救火。（Threads：imyoureunjae 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一人戴上氧氣罩送院治理。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200404412808302592682907.jpeg/1wCN4YzR2dG8kCyxqLKfOZLp1QHLBT-nWSiejHwonow\"/><figcaption>一人戴上氧氣罩送院治理。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場冒出大量濃煙。（Threads / imyoureunjae 影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200414787704459264602134.jpeg/rV7v53m5qgkKoJIqN0lN8fiOGpMSq__5pMe6KKTHuig\"/><figcaption>現場冒出大量濃煙。（Threads / imyoureunjae 影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工廈單位火光熊熊。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200401670740250624526431.jpeg/ZpXgeIhD_wAX-IGUTACfpI2O0Z2znbSyiEJmmIhCZpg\"/><figcaption>工廈單位火光熊熊。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有人抱貓逃生。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200403925077856256312097.jpeg/Jj8UaX44DjtHmnhO_EwKmICUw_3p0Qh4dEDAJVFAwCU\"/><figcaption>有人抱貓逃生。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"附近居民疏散。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200403927963668480684913.jpeg/NOY7S0P9fUpmAqsbLwoAaulNTjnIO06-BDkPxiE5D8Y\"/><figcaption>附近居民疏散。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方到場調查。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200403930740428800230967.jpeg/oqmzcMi6HOLwXcoQt81Tcr5Tnyo4dxMkSldwOW9XcDk\"/><figcaption>警方到場調查。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工廈人員疏散。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200411251008737280014576.jpeg/Cuu5RjFalYkETx2h-6imUMpyzBJ5HmcC3HeaD_l3mg8\"/><figcaption>工廈人員疏散。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200403936193286144204918.jpeg/AetYtCQUiFUi_1zLkEqwfKiOMY7tdA8ZLge49AsHuPQ\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防架起雲梯救火。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200403919319076864527163.jpeg/jZiD7Y2HjKL36GimIlr5ODm-vbR9BAVVBDWNBSE1jQU\"/><figcaption>消防架起雲梯救火。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防架起雲梯救火。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200403922636902400894031.jpeg/BKjHlGqDYpuxRXha04vKAdjkZRIlnPUz3LUM9fm1DPU\"/><figcaption>消防架起雲梯救火。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防架起雲梯救火。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200411247732854784957184.jpeg/zZCTJ6QnuOTGXfui0d-k3-c8zF_19XI1tkuTjpNLk44\"/><figcaption>消防架起雲梯救火。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方圍封現場。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200411254364311552620478.jpeg/dOzcNYqbOboMx7U6dP9OnbbPz0RX3jY0Pd_3-Bjf9_g\"/><figcaption>警方圍封現場。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200411258797821952279648.jpeg/NEozzsU47EZd6mG9_UwKFct2SMRcakxtlI6ODrGOjg4\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場是嘉名工廠大廈。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200405289757577216925643.jpeg/fItgCGD2J-XgqEcjyk2byNBkRQhY6XliCTsRuyw7Ebs\"/><figcaption>現場是嘉名工廠大廈。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200403933299085312057968.jpeg/Hq8-TQ5w0TBe2KM0Dg-PP_LH72llFYcL651fA86dXwM\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防到場救援。（黃學潤攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200405293360615424431596.jpeg/hfE0Uay6P4RE8fKYGYpPDci0ws7VV6PFj804JqrNOCY\"/><figcaption>消防到場救援。（黃學潤攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工廈單位火光熊熊，冒出濃煙。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200401672854310912298574.jpeg/rXMVQcbdS64CpQkUMLQvj9xsDRBBu9SdUPFxdlDxcXY\"/><figcaption>工廈單位火光熊熊，冒出濃煙。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"工廈單位火光熊熊。（網上圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261120/1200401667825078272247689.jpeg/NC0of2dKmgqA44FPSLuVmu6MGPmzb2Gbb3uaKm97mio\"/><figcaption>工廈單位火光熊熊。（網上圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:04:03.297244+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":619,"images":21,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T02:56:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T07:37:36.463742+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:57:32.083422+00:00","content_hash":"a7d2d17cffc91de09c7a54b0a52b3a9105dd138b0355885624f1b13434af17da","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}